  vendorName: Locksmith Kaelen
  offerText: Your door frame has been marked by the local thieves' guild. Pay me
    to install heavy iron deadbolts immediately, or you will certainly be robbed.
  acceptResultText: You pay the hefty sum. The new iron deadbolts are ugly and take
    up wall space, but you feel completely secure behind your reinforced door.
  rejectResultText: You laugh at his blatant fear-mongering and lock your normal
    door. You feel incredibly smart for not falling for his obvious scam.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Kaelen was telling the truth! The thieves easily kick down
    your compromised door while you sleep, beating you up and stealing your hidden
    savings!
